```
id: SPL-020
name: Mass file download from SharePoint or OneDrive (Office 365)
description: One user downloads a large number of files within an hour.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Collection
mitre_technique: T1530 Data from Cloud Storage
severity: Medium
data_source: index=o365
false_positives: Sync clients and approved migrations.
tuning: Exclude sync service accounts; use per-user baselines.
test_method: Download more than 100 files from a lab library in one hour.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=o365 sourcetype="o365:management:activity" Workload IN ("SharePoint","OneDrive") Operation IN ("FileDownloaded","FileSyncDownloadedFull") earliest=-1h
| stats count AS downloads dc(ObjectId) AS distinct_files values(ClientIP) AS source_ips BY UserId
| where downloads>=100
| sort - downloads
